[00:00.00]Hello - Adele
[00:03.00]   
[00:03.00]Written by：Adele Adkins/Greg Kurstin
[00:06.00]Hello it's me
[00:06.00:zh]你好 是我
[00:12.00]I was wondering if after all these years you'd like to meet
[00:12.00:zh]多年不见 你还想碰面吗？
[00:18.00]To go over everything
[00:18.00:zh]叙叙旧 聊聊天
[00:23.00]They say that time's supposed to heal ya but I ain't done much healing
[00:23.00:zh]别人都说时间能治愈一切 可我心伤依旧
[00:30.00]Hello can you hear me
[00:30.00:zh]喂？能听见吗？
[00:36.00]I'm in california dreaming about who we used to be
[00:36.00:zh]我在加州梦寐着你我曾经
[00:42.00]When we were younger and free
[00:42.00:zh]当时的我们自由又年轻
[00:48.00]I've forgotten how it felt before the world fell at our feet
[00:48.00:zh]我已忘记脚下的世界崩塌前的平静
[00:54.00]There's such a difference between us
[00:54.00:zh]我们之间太多分歧
[01:00.00]And a million miles
[01:00.00:zh]相距也太过遥远
[01:07.00]Hello from the other side
[01:07.00:zh]一声你好 来自世界彼端
[01:13.00]I must've called a thousand times to tell you
[01:13.00:zh]无数次拨打这个号码 只为告诉你
[01:20.00]I'm sorry for everything that I've done
[01:20.00:zh]我想为自己所做的一切说声抱歉
[01:24.00]But when I call you never seem to be home
[01:24.00:zh]但每次致电 总是无人接听
[01:31.00]Hello from the outside
[01:31.00:zh]一声你好 来自千里之外
[01:37.00]At least I can say that I've tried to tell you
[01:37.00:zh]至少我可以说 我曾努力想告诉你
[01:44.00]I'm sorry for breaking your heart
[01:44.00:zh]对不起 我伤透你心
[01:48.00]But it don't matter it clearly doesn't tear you apart anymore
[01:48.00:zh]但一切都已不重要 我已无法再令你心碎
[02:01.00]Hello how are you
[02:01.00:zh]你好 最近怎样？
[02:07.00]It's so typical of me to talk about myself
[02:07.00:zh]我总说自己的事
[02:12.00]I'm sorry I hope that you're well
[02:12.00:zh]抱歉 愿你一切安好
[02:19.00]Did you ever make it out of that town
[02:19.00:zh]你成功逃离
[02:23.00]Where nothing ever happened
[02:23.00:zh]那平淡无奇的小镇了吗？
[02:25.00]It's no secret
[02:25.00:zh]我们俩的时间已经所剩无几
[02:28.00]That the both of us are running out of time
[02:28.00:zh]这早已不是秘密
[02:38.00]So hello from the other side
[02:38.00:zh]一声你好 来自世界彼端
